# [NETMOD](../wg/netmod.html)

## Summary

The NETMOD Working Group met at IETF 127. The session covered working group status, updates on YANG Next / YANG 2.0 work items, progress across the YANG Versioning draft cluster, configuration templates, and several individual draft proposals covering string normalization, `anydata` validation, YANG path format (`ypath`), and comparability scope for operational state telemetry.

Key progress includes agreement to move the expired YANG Solutions draft to dead state, alignment on publishing the IANA guidance draft together as a cluster with the remaining versioning documents, initiation of bi-weekly YANG 2.0 triage calls, and consensus to pursue `ypath` as a standalone document.

